[gd_scene load_steps=14 format=3]

; LD-01 GATE 1 — Mistvale Vertical Slice Region greybox.
; Design authority: docs/LD-01-MISTVALE-REGION-MASTERPLAN.md
; Owned by the ART line. Nothing here touches MAIN's scenes.
;
; The walker is LDReviewWalker, not Player.tscn: see the header of
; scripts/world/ld_review_walker.gd for why. Player integration is a MAIN
; hand-off (masterplan §20).

